  designNotes: 'A Gift (Stuxnet reportedly got into Iran''s nuclear plant on USB
    sticks): you play it into an empty enemy slot and it joins their side. On arrival,
    a random other creature of its new side is Exhausted (infected), and it carries
    Heat Signature 1, pulling their random effects and your Homing ones.'
  artDescription: A lone USB stick lying on the asphalt of an empty parking lot under
    a streetlight, labelled SALARIES 2026 in marker, an employee in a lanyard bending
    down to pick it up, a nuclear plant's cooling tower behind the fence.
